<title>CANADA: Becker nine month Jan 31 turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Becker nine month Jan 31 turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			    1996</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	C$2.14   profit	C$0.22</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 3,665   profit	   408</p>
<p> Revs		     819,174			 NA</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Becker Milk Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Becker sold its dairy and convenience store operations to Silcorp Ltd on November 30, resulting in a net loss on discontinued operations of C$3.586 million. This included income tax provisions of C$2.1 million. Becker is now a real estate company.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8109))</p>
